   "versionNonce": 236069245,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reading the table\nAI < 200  -> raise AI (move fewer bytes)\nAI > 200  -> raise compute or cut FLOPs\nAI = 2000 is NOT 10x faster than AI = 200:\nboth already sit on the 100 TFLOPS roof.\nYou want ENOUGH AI to reach the roof,\nnot maximum AI.",
   "originalText": "Reading the table\nAI < 200  -> raise AI (move fewer bytes)\nAI > 200  -> raise compute or cut FLOPs\nAI = 2000 is NOT 10x faster than AI = 200:\nboth already sit on the 100 TFLOPS roof.\nYou want ENOUGH AI to reach the roof,\nnot maximum AI.",
   "fontSize": 16,
