   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Verdict\nMHA 1, GQA-8 4, MQA 32  vs  ridge ~200 (A100).\nEven the most aggressive sharing leaves decode\nattention at 16% of the ridge.\nMemory-bound at every H_kv.\nGQA's win = fewer BYTES (and VRAM), not a\nnew regime.",
   "originalText": "Verdict\nMHA 1, GQA-8 4, MQA 32  vs  ridge ~200 (A100).\nEven the most aggressive sharing leaves decode\nattention at 16% of the ridge.\nMemory-bound at every H_kv.\nGQA's win = fewer BYTES (and VRAM), not a\nnew regime.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e297",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e299",
