   "seed": 38830756,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 825373662,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "B=1:   1 x 1.555   = 1.56 TFLOPS  (0.5% of 312)\nB=8:   8 x 1.555   = 12.4\nB=32:  32 x 1.555  = 49.8\nB=128: 128 x 1.555 = 199\nB=200: 200 x 1.555 = 311  (ridge)\nB=256: capped at 312.\n\nThis is why continuous batching raises GPU\nutilisation, but the KV cache of each request\nis NOT shared, so attention AI never grows with B.",
   "originalText": "B=1:   1 x 1.555   = 1.56 TFLOPS  (0.5% of 312)\nB=8:   8 x 1.555   = 12.4\nB=32:  32 x 1.555  = 49.8\nB=128: 128 x 1.555 = 199\nB=200: 200 x 1.555 = 311  (ridge)\nB=256: capped at 312.\n\nThis is why continuous batching raises GPU\nutilisation, but the KV cache of each request\nis NOT shared, so attention AI never grows with B.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e322",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e324",
