   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 871766326,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "More Option-2 levers\n- GQA / MQA (H_kv)\n- MLA (H_kv*d_h -> d_c+d_R)\n- FlashAttention (no T x T traffic)\n- kernel fusion, data reuse\n- paged KV (capacity -> bigger batch,\n  not fewer bytes)\n- continuous batching (raises\n  weight-GEMM AI ~ B)",
   "originalText": "More Option-2 levers\n- GQA / MQA (H_kv)\n- MLA (H_kv*d_h -> d_c+d_R)\n- FlashAttention (no T x T traffic)\n- kernel fusion, data reuse\n- paged KV (capacity -> bigger batch,\n  not fewer bytes)\n- continuous batching (raises\n  weight-GEMM AI ~ B)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e339",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
