   "text": "Tensor Cores\nFP32 CUDA cores 20 TFLOPS\n-> BF16/FP16 Tensor Cores 100+ TFLOPS\n(FP8 / FP4 push the roof higher)",
   "originalText": "Tensor Cores\nFP32 CUDA cores 20 TFLOPS\n-> BF16/FP16 Tensor Cores 100+ TFLOPS\n(FP8 / FP4 push the roof higher)",
