   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Decode (AI ~ 1..30) lives far left of both ridges:\nbandwidth decides, so B wins.\nTraining/prefill (AI in the 1000s) lives right:\ncompute decides, so A wins.\nSame silicon, opposite answer.",
   "originalText": "Decode (AI ~ 1..30) lives far left of both ridges:\nbandwidth decides, so B wins.\nTraining/prefill (AI in the 1000s) lives right:\ncompute decides, so A wins.\nSame silicon, opposite answer.",
